Package: mcprofile
Title: Testing Generalized Linear Hypotheses for Generalized Linear Model Parameters by Profile Deviance
Version: 1.1-0
Authors@R: c(person("Daniel", "Gerhard", role = c("aut", "cre"),
		     email = "00gerhard@gmail.com"))
Description: Calculation of signed root deviance profiles for linear combinations of parameters in a generalized linear model. Multiple tests and simultaneous confidence intervals are provided.
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: ggplot2 (>= 3.4.0), quadprog, mvtnorm, splines
LazyData: yes
Encoding: UTF-8
License: GPL (>=2)
URL: https://daniel-gerhard.github.io/mcprofile/
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Suggests: knitr, rmarkdown, multcomp, MASS, testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.1
